  "description": "Attention trail riders: we know about your gravity addiction. The Shift 27.5-inch Plus Trail bike is your secret enabler, pushing you toward the drop-hucking, downhill riding dark side. Plush, fast-rolling, and incredibly grippy, tubeless 2.8\" WTB Ranger tires build in increased comfort and confidence over any type of rough terrain. Combine with the Shift 4-Bar Linkage R frame with 130mm of plush front and rear suspension, and you have everything you need to drop it in, and rip it up.\n6061-T6 alloy 4-Bar linkage frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, 130mm rear travel, 12x148mm Boost thru-axle dropouts\nRockShox Monarch RL Solo Air rear shock w/ rebound adjuster and lockout\nNew RockShox Revelation RL 27.5in Plus, taper steerer, 130mm travel; Boost 15x110mm thru-axle w/ Maxle Stealth axle & remote lockout\nNew FSA V-Drive Modular crankset w/ 30T Megatooth alloy chainring, Boost compatible\nShimano XT GS 11-spd Shadow Plus rear derailleur\nShimano XT 1x11-spd right shifter & 11-42 cassette\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus i35 double wall rims w/ TCS i35 rim tape, Tubeless ready\nNew WTB Ranger 27.5x2.8\" tires, Dual DNA, TCS, Aramid Beads\nRitchey Trail alloy cockpit w/ Trail WCS Lock-Ring grips\nNew Shimano SLX 7000 Hydraulic disc brakes",
